Third-party audio
-----------------

SkyHowl embeds a small amount of recorded audio by Jagadamba, obtained from
freesound.org (sound ids 253799-253826), used under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The recordings were modified: decoded to 48 kHz 16-bit mono, loudness matched
and embedded in the plugin binary. They are provided by their author without
warranty of any kind.

Everything SkyHowl's wind engine produces -- the flow, the airflow bed, the
buffet, the aeolian tones and the foliage -- is computed at run time and
contains no recorded material.

Reference recordings used elsewhere during development are not part of the
release and are not redistributable.
